# Mode timer, no item lit (listing 5097-5160, 5300-5330): the s_oneway2 hit (ControlCollision, type 1016, intro
# over is NOT required: Mode9Intro cleared by the sweep end at 5 s) starts mode_timer at Mode9Time = 30 s and shows text 3047.
# Hit at frame 700, no ramp-plane event: the timer expires 30 s later (frame 3700) and the mode leaves 9
# (ControlTimerExpired, Mode9Ramp == 0 -> CloseDragonJaw(0), info_text_box.message_field = 3, ControlMissionComplete).
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init dump_period 100
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
150 poke info_text_box message_field 9
151 event info_text_box ControlMissionComplete
700 event s_oneway2 ControlCollision
# listing: ControlMissionStarted text, string 3047
700 expect text info_text_box display id 3047
3691 expect mode == 9
# listing: expiry at 30 s with Mode9Ramp == 0 leaves mode 9
3721 expect mode != 9
3900 quit
